    "text": "ncktoday.com\nwebsite\nCloud County, Kansas\nCloud County Ducks Unlimited Chapter Holds 43rd Annual Banquet\n1 days ago\nThe Cloud County Chapter of Ducks Unlimited held their 43rd Annual Dinner Banquet on Saturday, October 3, 2025 at the Cloud County Fairgrounds. There were over 300 attendees that enjoyed an evening of a prime rib meal, several raffles, live and silent auction items and a nice, family friendly evening to support DU's mission to conserve, restore, and manage wetlands and associated habitats for North America's waterfowl, benefiting other wildlife and people.",
